     "question": "What total would you expect from six rolls of a die, and what is the expected value of one roll?",
     "solution": "理想情况下 1 到 6 各出现一次：1 + 2 + … + 6 = 21，平均每次 21 ÷ 6 = 3.5。用概率：E(X) = 1 × {{frac 1|6}} + 2 × {{frac 1|6}} + … + 6 × {{frac 1|6}} = {{frac 21|6}} = 3.5。实际掷 6 次结果可能和 21 差很多，掷很多次时平均数才会接近 3.5。",
